<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse shut on local religious holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse shut on local religious holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange was closed on Tuesday for a local religious holiday. It will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 100-Share Index closed 11.22 points, or 0.78 percent, lower at 1,430.90 on Monday, which was settlement day.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
